// The initializer := gives the initial value of a reference (kbak/clafer-semantics#164). A
// static model has a single state, so := is the same as =: [ some x => x.dref = e ] in the
// context of the parent. An initializer does not make a model temporal.

A 2
    x -> integer := 10
    y -> integer ? := x + 1
    zs -> integer 0..2 := 1, 2
abstract Val -> integer := 2
v1 : Val
